libmempressure (0.2.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Locale-free PSI parser that rejects out-of-range values.
  * Monotonic poll clock, handle counter overflow fix, monitor config race fix.
  * Export only the mp_ API; harden the Python, JNI and C++ bindings.

