libmempressure (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Quiescing mp_unsubscribe: safe callback teardown from any thread.
  * Shutdown ordering fixes, -EDEADLK from callbacks, prompt wake.
  * Config and psi source validation up front; robust c-locale parser.
  * Python gil deadlock fix; c++ exception-safe wrapper; jni registry
    cleanup.

